			"notes": "## Kill Clipper v1.11.4\n\n### Fixed\n- **Edit never opened some replays.** If a clip started right at the beginning of its recording (for example, a kill soon after joining a match), the replay waited forever before the world even loaded. Those replays open now.\n- **Kill clipping could switch itself off on Windows.** On startup the mod updates its settings file, but Windows didn't allow the file to be replaced while the mod was still reading it, and the mod then turned kill clipping off. Settings now save properly, and if saving ever fails, clipping stays on."
		},
