			"notes": "## Kill Clipper v1.11.3\n\n### Faster replays\n- Pressing Edit no longer freezes the game while the replay file is read. It loads in the background while the clip list says \"Opening the replay...\".\n- Opening a replay skips the old sounds, particles, explosions and chat from before the clip, so it gets to your clip faster. This matters most after a long time on one server.\n- Going back on the timeline no longer reads the whole replay file from disk again.\n\n### Download tip\n- Only download `killclipper-1.11.3.jar`. Releases no longer include the \"-sources\" jar, which looked the same but crashed the game."
		},
