			"notes": "## Kill Clipper v1.11.2\n\n### Fixed\n- **A replay that never opened could take over a real server.** If Edit got stuck on \"Opening the replay...\", the replay kept running in the background. Joining a server afterwards made the game flicker between the replay and the server, and some servers would not let you in. Joining any server now closes a replay first, and a replay never touches a world that isn't its own.\n- **Edit no longer hangs forever.** If a replay hasn't opened after 30 seconds, it stops and the clip list says why it couldn't load.\n- Pressing Done or Esc in the clip list while a replay is opening cancels it.\n- When a replay can't load, `logs/latest.log` now says what went wrong (look for lines starting with \"Replay\")."
		},
