			"notes": "## Kill Clipper v1.11.1\n\n### Fixed\n- **Edit did nothing after an export went wrong.** If an export failed partway (for example the video encoder stopped), the game's clock stayed held by the unfinished export, so the next replay could never load and pressing Edit looked like it did nothing. A failed export now lets go of the clock straight away, and the editor reopens with the reason it failed.\n- If no frame can be captured for 15 seconds, the export stops by itself instead of hanging.\n\n### Changed\n- The clip list shows \"Opening the replay...\" after you press Edit, so you can tell it is loading."
		},
