			"notes": "# Kill Clipper v1.10.0\n\n## Finished edits get their own folder\n- Exports from the clip editor are now saved in an **Edited** folder inside your clips folder (`killclips/Edited`), apart from the raw kill clips.\n- When an export is saved, it opens straight away in your video player so you can watch the finished edit. With the 9:16 shape on, the vertical version opens once it is made.\n- Trimmed videos from the video trimmer also go to the Edited folder and open when saved.\n- Clicking the \"Saved\" message in the editor opens the Edited folder.\n- Edited videos also show up in the clip list, so you can find them from the editor.\n- To stop exports from opening by themselves, set `\"openAfterExport\": false` in `config/killclipper.json`."
		},
