			"notes": "# Kill Clipper v1.9.2\n\n## Replays keep the fight after a win\n- When a win sent you back to the lobby, the replay saved next to the clip could show the lobby instead of the match. This happened when the duel started less than your before-kill time earlier: the replay was taken from the server you were on when the clip begins, which was the lobby.\n- The replay now comes from the server you were on when the kill happened. A kill or win announced right after you arrive in the lobby still uses the match you just left.\n- Clips you already saved keep their old replay; new fights are saved correctly."
		},
