			"notes": "# Kill Clipper v1.9.1\n\n## Smooth first-person aim\n- Your aim is now recorded on every frame you see, not just 20 times a second. Replays play it back frame by frame, so flicks and tracking look the way you played them instead of jittery.\n- This works for fights recorded with v1.9.1 or newer. Older replays still use the smoothed 20-per-second aim.\n\n## Share the edited clip\n- After an export, a **Get link** button appears next to the \"Saved\" message in the editor. It uploads the edited clip and copies a link you can paste in Discord."
